545-
546:When the task depends on benchmarked or release-grade agentic proof:
547:- distinguish `benchmark registry` from `benchmark execution state`
548:- distinguish `replay surface` from `replay execution state`
549-- distinguish threshold language from a real `adaptation lifecycle state`
550-- distinguish coding plausibility from a `Coding proof bundle memo`
